{"id":62,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"يُسَبِّحُ لِلَّهِ مَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَمَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَلِكِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُدُّوسِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"هُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى بَعَثَ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>ِيِّـ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـۧ</span>نَ رَسُول<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">اً م</span>ِّنْهُمْ يَتْلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> عَلَيْهِمْ ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بَ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحِكْمَةَ وَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>َانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لُ لَفِى ضَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ م</span>ُّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"وَءَاخَرِينَ مِنْهُمْ لَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا يَلْحَقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِهِمْ‌ۚ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajw